{"data":{"body":"[P1] Wait for the statement to finish before returning. `executeStatement` only submits asynchronous work, so later SQL/permission failures are silently lost. With `ON_CHANGE`, an older RUNNING MERGE can also finish after the SUCCEEDED MERGE and overwrite terminal state. Poll `DescribeStatement` to a terminal status with a bounded timeout, surface failures, and add the required IAM action and tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7uDryp","finding_digest":"ca6ef2a49f7cd4c80e3f1e5600a70a3102f670dece60a8620ff896830d3989d0","finding_id":"arf_v1_zjxpfje7ptkmqdr7dzlabjykge","finding_key":"insight-plugin/redshiftexporter::export::terminal-statement-ordering","identity_key":"insight-plugin/redshiftexporter::export::terminal-statement-ordering","line":116,"observation_digest":"5945fb9b99cb85635d5aade2fc445023817a9e7721b1634d798b5f0ac1a96f5d","observation_id":"aro_v1_lfc7xg4zzocwgxk2vxrpyrcqeo","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/RedshiftExporter.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-11T22:38:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fvb4mdyhvhqy66uufdxoiwogo4","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"360348e553f6a45c0fedda24ade3e79cf34b0f72","reviewer":"codex","start_line":107,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":704},"record_id":"art_v1_uzrvbndstztiu4s7pacqwhgrt7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T22:38:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
